* Gate 0c TRAN — anode photon pulse from KiCad bringup-supply
.title KiCad schematic
.title bringup-supply Gate 0c (KiCad export)
Vhv K GND DC -1000 
R10 K D1 4.4Meg
R11 D1 D2 3.3Meg
R12 D2 D3 3.3Meg
Ca A GND 15p
Ra A GND 1.1Meg
Iph A GND PULSE( 0 3.6m 50n 0.5n 0.5n 10n 1 ) 
R13 D3 D4 3.3Meg
R16 D6 D7 2.2Meg
Rbleed K GND 22Meg
R17 D7 D8 2.2Meg
R18 D8 GND 1.1Meg
R14 D4 D5 2.2Meg
R15 D5 D6 2.2Meg
.tran 0.2n 200n
.control
  run
  meas tran a_min MIN v(A) from=40n to=120n
  meas tran a_max MAX v(A) from=40n to=120n
  echo A_MIN = $&a_min
  echo A_MAX = $&a_max
.endc
.end
